    "summary": "The role router takes a role's tier from byRepo/global tasks with the core-floor clamp and its runner, model and effort only from the registry-resolved global tier (no byRepo.tiers layer, no DEFAULT_TIERS fallback); RoleResolution keeps its fields and gains fallback; RoleRouterDeps.registry is passed to buildShaperProvider/buildSummariserProvider (consumed in t5). readRepoOverride, resolveRepoShaperProvider, resolveRepoShaperModel and the repoOverride signal are removed with their callers in code-review-rpc.ts and workflow-rpc.ts, and their test file.",
